PREAMBLE

The OASIS API (Open Advanced Secure Interoperable Scalable-System) is the
core infrastructure layer that powers Our World — one of the most ambitious
open-world projects ever undertaken, designed to help empower humanity to
take responsibility for our planet. This license exists to keep the source
visible and available for learning, research, and internal use, while
ensuring that the vision behind this work is not commercially exploited
without the permission of the original authors.

This is not an open-source license as defined by the Open Source Initiative.
It is a source-available license with a commercial use restriction and a
dual-licensing model.

